WEBVTT

00:14:28.477 --> 00:14:31.502
ali sam u poslednje vreme proučavao prirodu.

00:14:31.502 --> 00:14:35.132
Znate, pčele dolaze u rojevima

00:14:35.132 --> 00:14:37.843
i ribe dolaze u jatima.

00:14:37.843 --> 00:14:40.656
Čvorci, u oblasti oko Edinburga

00:14:40.656 --> 00:14:42.139
u vresištima Engleske,

00:14:42.139 --> 00:14:44.233
dolaze u posebnim jatima,

00:14:44.233 --> 00:14:47.005
čiji se naziv murmuracija odnosi na žamor ptičjih krila

00:14:47.005 --> 00:14:48.918
i tokom dana čvorci

00:14:48.918 --> 00:14:50.783
lete u radijusu preko 30 km

00:14:50.783 --> 00:14:52.824
radeći njihovu stvar.

00:14:52.824 --> 00:14:54.588
Noću oni zajedno dolete

00:14:54.588 --> 00:14:56.710
i naprave jednu od najspektakularnijih stvari

00:14:56.710 --> 00:14:58.305
u celoj prirodi,

00:14:58.305 --> 00:15:00.359
koja se zove murmuracija (letenje vrlo blizu) .